# Features We Want To Replicate

## Assignment-Based Workflow

Students complete work within a specific assignment.

Desired Outcome:

```text
Class
↓
Assignment
↓
Submission
```

---

## Teacher Review Process

Teachers should be able to:

- Open a student submission
- Review audio
- Review transcript
- Assess participation
- Assign grades

---

## Reporting

Teachers should be able to:

- Review participation data
- Export data
- Analyze performance

---

## Audio-Centric Assessment

The recording remains the primary evidence of student participation.

The transcript is intended to support review rather than replace the original recording.

---

# Features We Intend To Improve

## Transcript Editing

PChat focuses heavily on speaking interactions.

The Speaking Portfolio System introduces:

```text
AI Transcript
↓
Student Review
↓
Student Editing
↓
Final Transcript
```

This becomes a central workflow.

---

## Individual Contribution Tracking

Each student uploads their own recording.

Example:

```text
Student A Recording
Student B Recording
Student C Recording
```

This provides stronger evidence of individual participation.

---

## Transcript Metrics

Metrics are generated from the student's final edited transcript.

Metrics include:

- Word Count
- Turn Count
- Average Words Per Turn

---

## Partner Comparison

Teachers should be able to compare conversation partners side-by-side.

Example:

```text
------------------------------------------------

Student A

Audio
Transcript
Metrics

------------------------------------------------

Student B

Audio
Transcript
Metrics

------------------------------------------------
```

This is a major feature of the new system.

