# Lessons Learned

The existence of PChat suggests that:

- Speaking assessment is a real educational need.
- Teachers benefit from workflow automation.
- Audio-based assessment scales better with reporting tools.
- Participation metrics are valuable.

These observations support the viability of the Speaking Portfolio System.

