# Reuse Policy

The PChat repository is being used as:

- A reference implementation
- A workflow reference
- A feature inspiration source

The goal of this project is to create an independent implementation for:

```text
Microsoft 365
+
SharePoint Online
+
SPFx
+
Power Automate
```

rather than a direct Moodle port.

Any future code reuse must comply with the license terms of the original repository.

